Hi there! Some little bugs fixed here!

PATCH v.0.9.14 
- Minor bugs fixed on Nafilis Healing SFX;
- Minor bugs fixed on SFX GO GO icon;
- Minor bugs fixed on AI Oyster enemy (Water Province);
- Minor bugs fixed on chest at the Enlightened Forest (Wind Province);
- Some adjustments on Rumble feature on Xbox gamepad;
- Steam Achievements enabled.

Patch v 0.9.9

- Now the Evil Tree subboss spawn 1 monkey for each hero;
- Implementation of Save System;
- Now you can revive a hero during the Stage in-game.

Patch v 0.9.8

- Removed lot of barricades and decreased the amount of Mushrooms in the Forest stage;
- Enemies now show a health bar above their heads;
- Reworked the ability cooldown system;
- Heroes now show the cooldown timer on their base;
- Monkey now throw fewer bananas;
- Now heroes can regenerate health by getting closer to the Nafilis statue in the sanctuary;
- Now is possible to go back to the main menu from the Sanctuary.

Patch - Version 0.9.7:

- Reworked Monkey AI;
- Monkey are no longer affected by the wind blow attack from the Evil Tree;
- Evil Tree's root damage decreased;
- More improvements on Lizard AI;
- Removed heroes health regeneration;
- Tweaked heroes health value;
- Tweaked enemies attack damage;

Patch - Version 0.9.6:

- Improvements on Lizard AI;
- Removed the Wishlist icons and buttons.

Hey everyone! We´ve been working hard in our game and we just uploaded our New Demo Version, just check it out and tell us what you think about it!

Bugs:
- Fixed bug where the language changes when you return to the main menu;

Gameplay Changes:
- Improvements on Evil Eye mechanics;
- Enemies hitboxes were increased;
- Improvements on Evil Small Tree AI;
- Input to enter in the Sanctuary just need to be pressed one time;
- Return to the map is automatic when you leave Sanctuary;
- Input was changed to Join in the heroes selection menu;
- The back input can be used to return to the main menu, when the heroes are cleared. 

