Hey everyone! We just updated our last Demo Version 0.9.2 ! We´ve changed some points including:

Gameplay Changes:
- Removed energy system, now the abilities are limited only by cooldown;
- Heroes no longer start the game with a ability;
- Evil Monkey can no longer attack while being hit;
- Enemies HP was slightly decreased;
- Evil Eye position was slightly lowered to be more easily hit;

